.”"},{"q":"Mia took her umbrella.","ans":"F","why":"didn’t take."},{"q":"They visited the old town.","ans":"F","why":"missed the tour."},{"q":"Tom was there too.","ans":"NG","why":"Não diz."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“wet” means…","opts":["molhado","seco","frio"],"ans":0,"why":"wet."},{"q":"“tour” means…","opts":["passeio","mapa","aula"],"ans":0,"why":"tour."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Grammar recap","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Tema","Lembrete"],"rows":[["Passado regular","**-ed** (worked, visited, loved)"],["Irregulares 1","**was/were, became, began, broke, brought, bought**"],["Negativo","**didn’t + verbo base**"],["Verb + to","**want to, plan to, hope to, decide to**"],["Pronúncia -ed","**/t/ /d/ /ɪd/**"]],"cap":"Resumo da Unidade 1"},{"type":"box","kind":"warn","t":"Erros que ainda aparecem","body":"**I didn’t went**, **I goed**, **She wanted going**"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice · Mixed review","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences (from the unit)","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"We ___ the old town. (visit)","a":"visited","why":"passado regular.","say":"We visited the old town"},{"s":"We ___ an onion last night. (chop)","a":"chopped","why":"dobra p."},{"s":"I ___ a cheap flight. (get)","a":"got","why":"passado."},{"s":"The bellboy ___ our bags. (carry)","a":"carried","why":"-ied."},{"s":"She wanted ___ the mountains. (see)","a":"to see","why":"want to."},{"s":"We ___ a taxi. (take)","a":"took","why":"irregular."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["traveler","viajante"],["tour","passeio guiado"],["arrange","organizar"],["come back","voltar"],["old town","cidade antiga"],["riverside","beira do rio"]]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Unit word bank","blocks":[{"type":"words","items":[["traveler","viajante"],["tour","passeio guiado"],["arrange","organizar"],["come back","voltar"],["old town","cidade antiga"],["riverside","beira do rio"],["souvenir","lembrança